        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions ATL05F, Modern Bling Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Acrylic Bling Door Pull is filled with glass crystals for a glittering look. Choose from 12 inch, 18 inch, and 24 inch lengths in surface mounting, thru-bolt mounting, or back-to-back mounting. The acrylic is manufactured with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading; this ultra clear acrylic allows the glass crystals to show their shimmering beauty. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Contemporary Bling Acrylic Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Clear Acrylic filled with Glass Crystals</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-ATL05F-specifications.pdf?v=1704262303\"><b>First Impressions ATL05F Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>FII-ATL05F012:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 10-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-2/3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-ATL05F018:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 16-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-2/3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-ATL05F024:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 22-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-2/3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This First Impressions door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including different center to center mounting distances and  <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Acrylic Bling Door Pull",
                "description": "The Modern Acrylic Bling Door Pull is filled with crystals for a glittering look. Choose from 12 inch, 18 inch, and 24 inch lengths in surface mounting, thru-bolt mounting, or back-to-back mounting. The acrylic is manufactured with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading; this ultra clear acrylic allows the glass crystals to show their shimmering beauty.",
